      "status": "implemented",
      "description": "Separate Alert page with draft CRUD, publish/resolve, searchable lifecycle and audience filters, pagination and scoped activity; no agent dispatch. Distinct hero imagery, compact 500ms live search with local loading, read-only detail summaries and explicit Edit draft forms retain shared chrome. Shared white record cards, header-aligned sticky section tabs with directional transitions, per-page cursor controls and refresh-safe query view intent; Logs-origin details suppress mutations and show correlation references only in Logs.",
      "web": {
